  "translation": "“All the servants of the king and the people of the provinces of the king know that ⟨for⟩ every man or woman who comes to the king, to the inner courtyard, who has not been called — one is his law: to put to death, except the one to whom the king extends ⟨את⟩ the scepter of gold, and he lives. And I have not been called to come to the king — these thirty days.”",
